Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:07.09,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,The sea of stars is dark\N and cold – a very scary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:13.96,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,A brave and wise king embarked\Non a trip aboard a magnificent ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:18.34,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{The ship glides, as it crosses the sea of stars.}The ship glides, crossing the sea of stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:23.49,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{An ugly ice planet, a soft and hot planet...}Among these stars are an ugly\N ice planet and a hot, soft planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:31.20,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,During the long, long journey, \Na lot of retainers, women, and children died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:38.65,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,The king cried,\N "Why did I undertake this journey ?"{wondering why he took the journey. }
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.65,0:00:41.07,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,He even forgot the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:47.07,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,Then, the ship turned around and began to glide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:51.18,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,There were twin planets\N where the ship was headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:57.09,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,The goddess offered one \Nof them to the king and told him...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.80,0:01:01.94,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,“I shall bestow upon \Nyour people the name…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.94,0:01:03.16,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,"…Garmillas.” {..."I name your people Garmillas."}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:09.91,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,If you stay by my side, \Nyou'll grow and prosper forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:17.42,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,The blessing echoed through the sea\N of stars, and everyone lived happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.20,0:01:27.07,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Sister !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:29.51,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,It's the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.51,0:01:31.05,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,The Yamato has come !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.71,0:01:36.67,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.67,0:01:39.56,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,That Earth ship and\N Iscandar share the same sin...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.67,0:01:44.34,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Did you call it to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:46.51,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,...Sasha ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:07.40,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Rapid turn at altitude 3500 !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:09.29,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Can you do it, Yabu ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.36,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,The engine sounds fantastic !\N We can do it !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.74,0:02:12.67,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,Tasuke !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:13.36,def2,TASUKE,0,0,0,,Got it !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:22.25,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,Pay attention until it's over !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.94,0:02:24.74,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,That's why you're still \Nsitting there, remember ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:37.85,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,All guns, start firing !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:39.27,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:52.31,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:04.04,Karaoke Translation op,{TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H000008&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(598,212)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:04.04,yamato,{TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\fscx167\fscy136\pos(640,872)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:04.04,def2,{TITLE,0,0,0,,{\pos(1384,638)} {\c&H000008&\3c&HFFFFFF&}A New Voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:10.18,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Follow the Yamato. \NDon't give the enemy a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:25.16,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,They're pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:28.42,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,All units, throw short jabs ! \NSink{Destroy } them with a barrage !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:57.67,def2,SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,Can you really call that\N fluttering bastard an airplane ?\N{Is that really an airplane,\N fluttering around like that ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:03:59.00,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Like you're one to talk ! {Look who's talking.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:09.25,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Anyway, draw the enemy\N away from the migrant fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:10.78,def2,GUYS,0,0,0,,Roger !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:15.20,def2,HILDE,0,0,0,,Okay, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.20,0:04:16.27,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,It's coming this way !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:33.89,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Prioritize the drifters in the ocean. \NSave as many as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:35.58,def2,RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Let's do it !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:44.71,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Shield deterioration 35%. \N150 seconds until depletion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:46.58,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Get the next shot ready quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:50.40,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,But if we remain in the resonant wave \Nmuch longer, it will damage our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:52.58,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,The Yamato and Hyuga will protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:02.07,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,Your Excellency, it's the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:03.02,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,The Yamato is....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:06.40,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Ranhalt's ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.27,0:05:10.05,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,Your Excellency ! Your Excellency !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:14.22,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Enemy fleet above the north \Npole is still holding position.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:21.54,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,That's the enemy main fleet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:24.74,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,After this much damage, \Nand they're still watching...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:27.29,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Nishina, how about sending \Nthem our greetings ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.07,0:05:31.51,def2,NISHINA,0,0,0,,It's a huge ship. \NLet me take some extra steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:41.91,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:46.07,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Your emotions will worsen the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:50.00,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Remember our objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:53.05,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Bring back Iscandar as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:57.34,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{Bring this cursed planet to our home.}This abominable planet…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:58.94,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{Bring this cursed planet to our home.}…bring it to our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:08.98,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,It looks like the enemy\N fleet has begun withdrawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:10.98,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,It's unexpectedly weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.09,0:06:13.36,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Pursuit order to the aerial unit ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:14.82,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.16,0:06:32.05,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,Give everyone hot soup !\NElderly and children first !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.65,0:06:34.16,def2,RAIDEN,0,0,0,,You guys did so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:36.47,def2,RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Now you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.09,def2,RAIDEN,0,0,0,,You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:53.22,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,So we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:00.82,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Sorry for being late, Berger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:05.42,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,{We just have to fight back, \Ntogether with the Yamato.}From here on, we'll take the fight \Nto them, side by side with Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.29,0:07:20.54,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Now, I want everyone to take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:27.31,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,{Sorry, but look at it carefully.}I apologize, \Nbut please take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:34.07,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,Iscandar should have \Nsuffered catastrophic damage...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:41.11,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,...but the shattered pieces of the destroyed planet turned into dust, and its energy...{is}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:43.96,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,...vanished{lost} ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:47.27,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{No, more like transferred.}Not quite.\N It was most likely {\i1}transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:53.22,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,These spiky objects seem to be \Nsome kind of transfer machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:58.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{After destroying a planet, they \Nconverged the energy to a single location.}After destroying a planet, they amass and converge the energy to a single location.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:03.29,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,I can see why our enemy's come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:10.34,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,We're in the Bolzon system,\N and its sun is getting old and bloated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.31,0:08:16.49,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,This is the state of the first planet Garmario as \Nit's been pulled by the gravity of the expanding sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:18.91,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Right now, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:22.27,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}There're too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:24.94,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}The equator is like a field of spikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:25.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Total number is unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:30.31,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The planet is dying, just like Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.31,0:08:33.85,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That means, it's easy to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:38.29,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,They remove and warp planets...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:41.62,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...as if they're playing space billiards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:45.80,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,So, that's how Dezariam does it, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:51.42,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,In order to warp Iscandar, \Nour planet, Garmillas was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:55.69,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Dezariam is going to use its cue stick again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:09:00.05,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Garmario is about the same size as Jupiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:02.51,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That'll allow them an even longer warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:07.29,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,We must stop them now, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:10.74,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,But we lost half our fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:16.67,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,The condition of the Deusula III is obvious,\N and I heard His Excellency Desler was badly hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.71,0:09:22.74,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,We also have to come up with a way to save \N100,000 of our fellow citizens of the migrant fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:26.31,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Plus Starsha and her sister, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:30.94,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,That's a given...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:33.31,def2,FLAKEN,0,0,0,,...but how are we going to fight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:35.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,With the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:38.76,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We'll destroy the planet\N with the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:42.79,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{yamato}Garmario will be destroyed by simultaneous shots of the wave motion guns from the Yamato and Hyuga...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:44.80,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{desalium}...before Dezariam can use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:47.16,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:53.47,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Captain, have you considered every alternative ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:57.69,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That's the most effective measure\N with our current strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.78,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,How about the impact of \Nthe planet's destruction on Iscandar ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:03.94,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Iscandar's still in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:06.87,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We have to carry out the operation\N before it enters the danger zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:07.94,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,That's too hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:10.07,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I said we have no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.07,0:10:15.69,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,You're going to use the wave motion gun in \Nfront of Starsha of Iscandar to destroy a planet....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:18.96,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{joukyou}...as well as our enemy,\N if the situation calls for it, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:21.87,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:24.16,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I'll take full responsibility for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:33.71,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Regardless of the enemy's purpose, \Nthey destroyed Garmillas without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:39.02,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{seikan}We're allowed to take any countermeasures\N in light of the universe's common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.11,0:10:45.94,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,That planet is dead with no life on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:48.82,def2,GOL,0,0,0,,{Starsha, and even God, will forgive us.}Whether it be Starsha, or even God, \Nwe will surely be forgiven. Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:54.31,def2,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Use the wave motion gun\N to destroy a planet ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:57.09,def2,BANDO,0,0,0,,If we're lucky, we can \Nwipe out the enemy fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:11:00.11,def2,TASUKE,0,0,0,,That's a big decision for Captain Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:04.24,def2,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,{We just made first \Ncontact with those aliens.}But we just made first\Ncontact with those aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:06.78,def2,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Is it okay for us to be doing this ?{to do that all by ourselves ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:11.16,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,The fight{battle} has already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:16.49,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,{The rationale here is that we can't choose our means because we have 100,000 civilians.}With 100,000 civilians to worry about, any other\Nmeans for resolving this conflict are out of our hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.49,0:11:17.62,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Or so the reasoning goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:21.05,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,{yamato}{But I thought the Yamato and the man named\N Kodai Susumu would reject such rationales.}But I thought the Yamato…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.05,0:11:23.67,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,{yamato}{But I thought the Yamato and the man named\N Kodai Susumu would reject such rationales.}…or rather, the man \Nnamed Kodai Susumu…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:29.34,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,{yamato}…would reject such rationales.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.11,0:11:39.29,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,You heard Melda's report, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:42.18,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,The Yamato will do what's necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:44.60,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{What about us ?}What should we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.85,0:11:57.67,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,We don't have any record\N of an encounter with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:01.89,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,It must be a part of the {\i1}"Great Loss."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:05.02,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,Who are they ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:08.62,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,Why are they trying to\N save the lives of others...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:12.69,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,...by staking their own lives...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:38.94,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Their course is within our prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:42.25,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,0800 seconds till it enters the kill zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.82,0:12:44.34,def2,NISHINA,0,0,0,,They took the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:46.29,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,Come here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:49.82,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,The shockwave from Garmario's\N destruction will wipe you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:52.47,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:58.31,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,Connected to the energy channel \Nof the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:00.45,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,, Compulsive injector operation, confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:03.11,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{Final safety, unlocked.}Final safety, released.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.96,0:13:09.45,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,This noise...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:24.05,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,The planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:24.76,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Sister ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:29.29,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Iscandar changed course ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.47,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Unknown type of energy detected at the poles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.58,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Iscandar's turning around and accelerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:41.00,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,It'll enter the kill zone \Nsoon at breakneck speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:44.45,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,At this rate, Garmario's shockwave will directly...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:51.56,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,The line of fire is getting blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.34,0:13:54.94,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,They're using Iscandar as a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.89,0:14:07.02,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{Yamato, can you hear me ?}Those above us, can you hear me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:10.82,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}This is Yurisha of Iscandar speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.27,0:14:12.42,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yurisha...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:16.07,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I'm going to inform you of \Nmy sister Starsha's intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.47,0:14:18.82,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Iscandar...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:21.02,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}...please shoot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:33.80,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Iscandar has a vast\N underground space called Sanktel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:39.96,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{sonotame}Its energy lines are laid \Nthroughout the planet like a web.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:44.91,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{sono}Aim at a node, and that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:50.67,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{zahyo}I'll let you know the \Ncoordinates and penetration power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:57.22,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{teki}Even though the planet's covered with the enemy's \Nmomentum control field, a significant shock is expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:04.65,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{Garmillas}In order to protect the people of the Garmillas migrant fleet, please raise a shield in synch with your firing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:07.78,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Coordinates{data} verified.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.31,0:15:10.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Wave motion excavation shell...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.20,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Shield shell...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:13.54,def2,BOTH,0,0,0,,{\pos(706,1054)\c&HFFFE9F&\i1}Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:13.54,def2,BOTH,0,0,0,,{\pos(1248,1052)\i1}Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:44.96,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Sister !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:11.67,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Iscandar has begun accelerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:15.36,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,It's leaving the kill zone !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:29.89,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Kodai, it's a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.89,0:16:34.58,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Something similar to wave motion energy\N is gushing out, although it's weakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.49,0:16:36.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Starsha...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:42.67,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Resume countdown for the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.67,0:16:45.89,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We don't have time to regroup\N with the Hyuga and Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:48.45,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{Re-calibrate for Yamato's single shot.}Re-calibrate Yamato’s wave \Nmotion gun for single shot use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:52.29,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Aim at the ideal point for target destruction...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:00.27,def2,DADAR,0,0,0,,Your interference ends here !{I won't let you do any more !}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:02.78,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,The enemy main fleet is in our line of fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.47,0:17:04.85,def2,NISHINA,0,0,0,,They came back already ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.18,0:17:08.07,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Ignore them{Don't bother} !\N Kitano, is the firing line clear ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:10.09,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,Iscandar will be hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.65,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,, I need 250 seconds !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:18.82,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,She can't use the wave motion shield \Nwhile energizing the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:20.29,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,She won't last two minutes !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:22.91,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,We have to cover her quickly !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:25.04,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Can't we go any faster ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:26.82,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,We have to go around the kill zone !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:28.96,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,The shortest time is 300 seconds !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:30.67,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.34,0:17:36.96,def2,DADAR,0,0,0,,Why can't we hit it ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:39.11,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Because of Iscandar's gravitational inclination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.67,0:17:43.54,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The speed is fluctuating, so we can't\N lock onto the correct modification factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:46.54,def2,DADAR,0,0,0,,Then get closer !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:54.98,def2,DADAR,0,0,0,,“Blood-curdling,”\Nis that what this is called…?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:59.05,def2,DADAR,0,0,0,,{My body feels a thousand years \Nof Dezariam's dream. I'm positive.}{so sure.}Dezariam’s thousand year dream…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:01.89,def2,DADAR,0,0,0,,It’s just within my grasp.\NOf that I am sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:10.98,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Allow me to speak freely !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:14.98,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,The enemy's firing accuracy is rising.\NPlease consider aborting the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:20.74,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Now that the enemy knows our objective, \Nwe'll have no second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.27,0:18:21.98,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:22.98,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:28.58,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,If we use our energy reserves allocated for restart, \Nwe can use the wave motion shield for 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:32.87,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,But we won't be able to restart the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.49,0:18:35.98,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,We'll be stuck after firing the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:38.07,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Is that alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:41.54,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:42.82,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Captain !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:48.47,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We can't waste Iscandar's\N sacrifice and let this chance go !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:55.22,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:57.49,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We can't waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.87,0:19:02.36,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...their trust and sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:05.56,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yamato can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:13.27,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,The Yamato isn't just yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:21.71,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Depletion of the wave motion shield in twenty-nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.71,0:19:22.89,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Twenty-eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.89,0:19:24.02,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Twenty-seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.11,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Twenty-six.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.11,0:19:26.16,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Twenty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:27.22,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Twenty-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:28.27,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Twenty-three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:28.85,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Twenty-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.42,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:36.25,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:44.71,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:45.65,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.65,0:19:46.56,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:47.51,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:48.40,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:49.31,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:49.80,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:53.18,def2,KITANO,0,0,0,,Line of fire, clear. We can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:55.65,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Fire the wave motion gun !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:41.62,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Shockwave arrival ! Status, irregular !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.91,0:20:44.25,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Crank up the sub engine, \Nand we can get away !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:45.02,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Engine Chief ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:48.78,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Impossible !\N We used up all our energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:20:59.20,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.89,0:21:04.02,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I bear responsibility for this…{I'm responsible for this...}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:06.24,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}You mean {\i1}we all{\i0} bear it, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:19.38,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,The responsibility isn't yours alone !\N It's {\i1}ours,{\i0} isn't it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:20.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Pull back !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.79,0:21:22.31,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,No way !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:23.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Even though we're on different ships...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:25.90,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Pull back !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:27.16,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,No more sacrifices...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:28.49,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,We're all in this together !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.91,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}That's what all of us decided that day !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.91,0:21:37.45,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}So why are you trying to\N shoulder this all by yourself ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.18,0:21:43.85,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Don't be arrogant, Kodai Susumu !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.87,0:21:52.51,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Fly-wheel restarted...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.82,0:21:54.51,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,The resonant wave from Asuka did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.18,0:22:00.16,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Second shockwave, incoming !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:01.54,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Engine power ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.89,0:22:03.27,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Twenty more seconds !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:22.78,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:34.59,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{A cursed planet is defended \Nby cursed people after all.}A detestable planet is defended \Nby detestable people after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:41.29,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,{You don't know what your\N damned power will bring.}You have no idea what your\Naccursed power will bring forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.29,0:22:45.04,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\3c&H000008&\pos(506,1052)}Emergency Order! Yamato, Shoot Iscandar!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.29,0:22:45.04,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(210,874)\3c&H000008&}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.42,0:22:58.82,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kanashimi no ushiro de itsumo}Behind the sorrow...\N{\i1}kanashimi no ushiro de itsumo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.34,0:23:04.92,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{tsugi wa shiawase ga matteiru}...happiness is always waiting for you{next}\N{\i1}tsugi wa shiawase ga matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.18,0:23:17.84,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{sonna guuwa wo shinjitsuni kaemashou}Let's turn that fairy tale into truth\N{\i1}sonna guuwa wo shinjitsuni kaemashou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.46,0:23:29.50,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{anata no me ga mabushisouni sasayaku}You whisper with a spark in your eye\N{\i1}anata no me ga mabushisouni sasayaku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.36,0:23:47.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{yume wo miru no wa kizutsuku tame janai}You don’t dream to get hurt\N{\i1}yume wo miru no wa kizutsuku tame janai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.32,0:23:55.88,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ai wa ima mo hikari}Love still shines even now\N{\i1}ai wa ima mo hikari
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.89,0:24:03.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{tada hitotsu no inori}There’s only one prayer\N{\i1}tada hitotsu no inori
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:12.11,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{mirai wa mou hajimatte iru}The future has already begun\N{\i1}mirai wa mou hajimatte iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:59.24,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(688,832)}Susumu Kodai:\NYuki Mori:\NDaisuke Shima:\NShiro Sanada:\NRyusuke Domon:\NMiyako Kyozuka: \NHeiji Bando: \NTasuke Tokugawa:\NShigeru Sakamoto:\NCaroline Raiden:\NMiki Saijo:\NAkira Yamamoto: \NKaoru Niimi: \NYasuo Nanbu:\NYoshikazu Aihara:\NKenjiro Ohta:
